        "changes": [
          "Keep upstream explicit-only metadata. The description names only $in-your-own-words and /in-your-own-words.",
          "Add Chinese rules: a fallible reading, guessed causes marked as guesses, one decision when two readings change the outcome, stop for confirmation.",
