        "mode": "translated-and-adapted",
        "changes": [
          "Translate into Chinese and drop pictures, /visualize, and video. Voice rules are inlined. No bro dependency.",
          "Catch-up is read-only and stays within about 300 Chinese characters. Decision items stay, about 60 characters each. The handoff file is not under that cap.",
          "A handoff note is for a later session or another computer. Giving the work to another agent now is orca-cli, and the note can still be written.",
          "Pickup reads the note, checks claimed completions, reports, then continues only listed next steps."
